// When quiet HUD elements show (crates/base/src/hud.rs, `Calm`). Everything
// that hides is still listed in the journal (Tab / J, the Bag tab's "Right now").
// Edit and save: the running game picks it up within a second.
(
    // Seconds an element stays fully visible after its value changes.
    show_secs: 4.0,
    // Seconds it then takes to fade away.
    fade_secs: 1.0,
    // Metres: within this of an element's place (the landlord, Dave's
    // parliament, your cat) it stays up.
    near_metres: 12.0,
    // A countdown at or under this many seconds counts as urgent (the rent raise).
    urgent_secs: 20.0,
    // A meter at or over this percent counts as urgent (HALT's wrath, your cat's size).
    urgent_percent: 75.0,
    // The fart meter shows once it's filled past this percent (and always when ready).
    gas_show_percent: 50.0,
    // Seconds from joining that the key hints (Tab / J journal, M mic) stay up.
    hint_secs: 90.0,
)
